Subject: Analysis of Measurement Invariance with multiple imputed data and categorical variables
Message-ID: <8n0BB0jJ4Ks.qH26rnNAAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/8n0BB0jJ4Ks/m/qH26rnNAAwAJ>
